":"朝中官员最常见的冠帽之一，多在诸侯朝服时佩戴。","en":"One of the most common caps among court officials, typically worn by lords in formal court dress."},"defenceVal":"3","mp":"800","price":"3000","slot":{"zh":"头盔","en":"Helmet"}}],"family":{"children":{"label":{"zh":"子女","en":"Children"},"people":[{"id":"WJ1041815","code":"100"}]}},"clans":[{"id":"GI105615","name":{"zh":"西平郭氏","en":"The Guo clan of Xiping"},"years":["0","999"],"desc":{"zh":"出自姬姓，虢叔之后。世为河右大族，魏明帝郭皇后家族。河西大族，明元郭皇后为魏明帝后，在曹魏后期影响朝政。为凉州士族中通过外戚身份进入权力核心的典型代表。","en":"Descended from the Ji surname, lineage of Guo Shu. A prominent clan of Heyou for generations, and the Family of Empress Guo, consort to Emperor Ming of Wei. A powerful house of Hexi, Empress Mingyuan Guo became empress to Emperor Ming of Wei and exerted profound influence over imperial governance during the late Cao Wei era. They stand as a quintessential example of Liang Province gentry ascending to the inner circle of power through maternal imperial relations."},"talent":{"military":"3","commerce":"2","politics":"6"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"郭满","height":"较矮","shape":"一般"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":1,"from":"194","to":"219"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1033","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[15,10,35,44,30,32],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"9850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1033","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"0","role":0,"stats":[15,10,35,44,30,32],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"9850","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007102","armor":"WP1014005","helmet":"WP1025105"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"